# TASK.md working contract

For ticket-sized work, multi-session work, or any task delegated to subagents,
use a root `TASK.md` as the current contract.

- Read it before planning or editing.
- Keep the goal, in-scope/out-of-scope boundaries, acceptance criteria,
  decisions, current status, and verification commands concise and current.
- Record blockers and command evidence, not raw Gradle logs.
- Update it before context summarization, delegation, or handoff.
- Do not silently broaden the task beyond it. Update the contract first when
  the user changes scope.
- Treat it as branch working state. Commit it only when the task explicitly
  requires a durable handoff artifact; otherwise remove it before the final
  product commit.
